<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.3 Evaluation &amp; Statistical Analysis ‣ 5 Experimental Details ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Paired bootstrap for statistical significance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.3 Evaluation &amp; Statistical Analysis ‣ 5 Experimental Details ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Aggregate reporting.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS1" title="In 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.1 </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Baseline</span> Performance</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2 </span>Contrastive vs. non-contrastive generation</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS0.Px1" title="In 6.2 Contrastive vs. non-contrastive generation ‣ 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Setup.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6.2 Contrastive vs. non-contrastive generation ‣ 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Aggregate performance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In 6.2 Contrastive vs. non-contrastive generation ‣ 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Language modeling (Perplexity).</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS0.Px4" title="In 6.2 Contrastive vs. non-contrastive generation ‣ 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Task-level pattern and head-to-head.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS0.Px5" title="In 6.2 Contrastive vs. non-contrastive generation ‣ 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Is it the <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{V}_{\text{head}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mtext>head</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{V}_{\text{head}}}</annotation></semantics></math> mask or the contrastive logits?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS0.Px6" title="In 6.2 Contrastive vs. non-contrastive generation ‣ 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Takeaway.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Searching for Effective <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{CD}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖢𝖣</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{CD}</annotation></semantics></math> Settings</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS4" title="In 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.4 </span>Effect of truncation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS5" title="In 6 Results ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.5 </span>Mixing Ratio Ablation</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Discussion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Mixing synthetic data helps; <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{CD}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖢𝖣</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{CD}</annotation></semantics></math> helps most where reasoning is required.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Contrastive <em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">scoring</em>, not head masking, is the key ingredient.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">A practical amateur: earlier checkpoints are a strong and simple choice.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Broader implications.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Limitations</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Scale and budget.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Amateur choice and hyperparameters.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Compute and memory overhead.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Distributional narrowing.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Safety, bias, and factuality.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ Contrastive Decoding for Synthetic Data Generationin Low-Resource Language Modeling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Single iteration.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
